        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWonderful 3 Bed Semi-Detached......House Type B- 3 Bed Semi Detached3 bed Semi-detached 475,000c. 114m2/c. 1225 sq. ftLarge GardenOpen Plan Kitchen/DiningLarge Living RoomUtility Room Built in WardrobeGranite WorktopDesigner KitchenEn-suite, Guest w.c and Main BathroomAmple parking\nA-RatedDNG New Homes are delighted to introduce Eascanrath Brook, a charming new development comprising 3 & 4 bed homes, located in one of most sought-after areas.These elegant homes have been finished to an exceptional standard and specification. Each home is designed to have contemporary features and spacious light-filled rooms that create an efficient living environment with stunning finishes throughout.The bright light filled accommodation comprises entrance hall, guest w.c, living, kitchen/dining, utility room, three generous rooms, en-suite and main bathroom. Ample parking to front and spacious rear garden. Register your interest today."
